{% comment %}
  SAMAY PARFUMES - SHARED FAQ ACCORDION SNIPPET
  Accessible, luxury styled accordion for homepage and dedicated FAQ page.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="samay-faq-box" id="faqAccordionWrap">
  <div class="samay-faq-item is-open">
    <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question" id="SharedFaqQ1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="SharedFaqA1">
      <span>How long does Zayro last on skin and clothes?</span>
      <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
    </button>
    <div class="samay-faq-answer" id="SharedFaqA1" role="region" aria-labelledby="SharedFaqQ1">
      Zayro is formulated as an Eau de Parfum (EDP) with 15-20% perfume oil concentration. On moisturized skin, it lasts 6 to 8 hours. On clothing and outerwear, its rich amber and agarwood base notes can linger throughout the day.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="samay-faq-item">
    <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question" id="SharedFaqQ2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SharedFaqA2">
      <span>What is the difference between the single and combo packs?</span>
      <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
    </button>
    <div class="samay-faq-answer" id="SharedFaqA2" role="region" aria-labelledby="SharedFaqQ2">
      The fragrance formulation in all 3 packs is identical (Zayro 50ml). The 2-in-1 Duo combo and 3-in-1 Grand Trio include complimentary luxury presentation gift boxes.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="samay-faq-item">
    <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question" id="SharedFaqQ3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SharedFaqA3">
      <span>What are the shipping times and is delivery free?</span>
      <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
    </button>
    <div class="samay-faq-answer" id="SharedFaqA3" role="region" aria-labelledby="SharedFaqQ3">
      Yes, shipping is 100% complimentary across all pin codes in India for all orders. Metro cities (Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bangalore, Pune) typically receive delivery in 2-3 business days. All other locations take 3-5 business days with live tracking provided via SMS and email notifications.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="samay-faq-item">
    <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question" id="SharedFaqQ4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SharedFaqA4">
      <span>What is your damaged replacement guarantee?</span>
      <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
    </button>
    <div class="samay-faq-answer" id="SharedFaqA4" role="region" aria-labelledby="SharedFaqQ4">
      Every bottle is packaged inside thick shock-resistant transit cushions. In the rare event of transit damage or leakage, simply share a quick photo with our team within 48 hours and we will dispatch a brand-new replacement bottle immediately with zero hassle. For complete details, see our <a href="/policies/refund-policy" class="gold-link">Refund Policy</a>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="samay-faq-item">
    <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question" id="SharedFaqQ5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SharedFaqA5">
      <span>Is Cash on Delivery (COD) supported?</span>
      <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
    </button>
    <div class="samay-faq-answer" id="SharedFaqA5" role="region" aria-labelledby="SharedFaqQ5">
      Yes! We accept Cash on Delivery (COD), UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm), and all major credit/debit cards during checkout.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="samay-faq-item">
    <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question" id="SharedFaqQ6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SharedFaqA6">
      <span>How should I store my bottle of Zayro?</span>
      <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
    </button>
    <div class="samay-faq-answer" id="SharedFaqA6" role="region" aria-labelledby="SharedFaqQ6">
      To preserve the potency of pure perfume oils and natural essences, store your flacon in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and extreme temperature variations. Keep the magnetic cap securely snapped when not in use.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  (function() {
    function initSharedFaq() {
      var wrap = document.getElementById('faqAccordionWrap');
      if (!wrap) return;
      var questions = wrap.querySelectorAll('.samay-faq-question');
      questions.forEach(function(btn) {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
          var item = btn.closest('.samay-faq-item');
          if (!item) return;
          var isOpen = item.classList.contains('is-open');
          item.classList.toggle('is-open', !isOpen);
          btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !isOpen);
        });
      });
    }
    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initSharedFaq);
    } else {
      initSharedFaq();
    }
  })();
</script>
